{"id":"torrey:hatred-to-christ","source":"torrey","name":"Hatred To Christ","slug":"hatred-to-christ","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is without cause — Ps 69:4; Joh 15:25.","refs":[["Ps",69,4,69,4],["John",15,25,15,25]]},{"text":"Is on account of his testimony against the world — Joh 7:7.","refs":[["John",7,7,7,7]]},{"text":"Hatred to his Father. — Joh 15:23,24.","refs":[["John",15,23,15,23],["John",15,24,15,24]]},{"text":"Hatred to his people. — Joh 15:18.","refs":[["John",15,18,15,18]]},{"text":"Punishment of — Ps 2:2,9; 21:8.","refs":[["Ps",2,2,2,2],["Ps",2,9,2,9],["Ps",21,8,21,8]]},{"text":"No escape for those who persevere in — 1Co 15:25; Heb 10:29-31.","refs":[["1Cor",15,25,15,25],["Heb",10,29,10,31]]},{"text":"Illustrated — Lu 19:12-14,17.","refs":[["Luke",19,12,19,14],["Luke",19,17,19,17]]},{"text":"Chief priests & c. — Mt 27:1,2; Lu 22:5.","refs":[["Matt",27,1,27,1],["Matt",27,2,27,2],["Luke",22,5,22,5]]},{"text":"Jews. — Mt 27:22,23.","refs":[["Matt",27,22,27,22],["Matt",27,23,27,23]]},{"text":"Scribes & c. — Mr 11:18; Lu 11:53,54.","refs":[["Mark",11,18,11,18],["Luke",11,53,11,53],["Luke",11,54,11,54]]}],"refCount":21}
